 Ryūsei Ningen Zone, is a tokusatsu science fiction superhero television series. Produced by Toho Company Ltd., the show aired on Nippon Television from April 2 to September 24, 1973, with a total of 26 episodes, it was cancelled due to the oil crisis of 1973. This was Toho's answer to not only the popular Ultra Series, but the Henshin Hero phenomenon started by shows like Kamen Rider and Android Kikaider. The previous year, Toho had just made their successful first superhero show, Rainbowman. The series was also notable for its guest appearance by Toho's own Godzilla, as well as two other Toho monsters, King Ghidorah and Gigan. Supplementary materials published by Toho have confirmed Zone Fighter to be part of the Showa-era Godzilla series, taking place in between Godzilla vs. Megalon and Godzilla vs. Mechagodzilla.", 'popularity': 0.8239, 'poster_path': '/jstFGUb5oriwQFjTUonbnKQWg8J.jpg', 'first_air_date': '1973-04-02', 'name': 'Zone Fighter', 'vote_average': 7.7, 'vote_count': 3}, {'adult': False, 'backdrop_path': '/eBPogSP7DklWd1GeSfvYrJy35BV.jpg', 'genre_ids': [10764], 'id': 235726, 'origin_country': ['TW'], 'original_language': 'zh', 'original_name': '二呆流浪記之完全大人手冊', 'overview': '由新生代演员曾敬骅、朱轩洋搭档，开着小卡车「二呆号」全台趴趴走，一起经历 7堂转大人课题。无论是脱离舒适圈到兰屿泳渡无人岛，或者马祖换宿生活养成责任感，还是跟着协助负重踏上布农族寻根之路⋯都是他们必须完成的考验。\n\n旅程中正值「25 岁」的两个男孩，将面临体力负荷、价值观冲击、内心纠结…等种种挑战，同时又得尝试着摸索出所谓「大人的模样」⋯\n\n初闯江湖的二呆，能关关难过关关过，顺利「转骨」成功吗？', 'popularity': 0.7941, 'poster_path': '/g8lYDlL2woq91pesI4m4PHOs6t9.jpg', 'first_air_date': '2023-12-17', 'name': '二呆流浪记之完全大人手册', 'vote_average': 10.0, 'vote_count': 1}, {'adult': False, 'backdrop_path': '/86e66TNA46GobaPOt5Kut9NEcOh.jpg', 'genre_ids': [10764], 'id': 293046, 'origin_country': ['HK'], 'original_language': 'cn', 'original_name': '许鞍华数风流人物', 'overview': '一連五集，每集三十分鐘名人傳記式專訪節目。導演許鞍華，以不同表達手法透視影壇才俊鄧光榮、漫畫界風雲人物黃玉郎、影壇炙手可熱的導演爾冬陞、金馬影后吳家麗及名媛何超瓊……等星光背後的真貌，及鮮為大眾所知的生活軼事', 'popularity': 1.0109, 'poster_path': '/5YLfhrU4RLk0GgadMAb4jFu1JGc.jpg', 'first_air_date': '1992-02-01', 'name': 