2025-10-05 04:25:53 [INFO] app.flow.sync_new_movie_flow:247 - 已将该影视元数据入库[Movie(id=ObjectId('68e0e3c8299c4be8fb138ba4'), revision_id=None, douban_id='36645835', title='一笑随歌', title_season='一笑随歌', original_title_season='', original_title='', subtitle=None, pic=None, description='平陵之战，锦绣女将付一笑（李沁 饰）一箭射落夙砂大皇子凤随歌（陈哲远 饰），凭一己之力扭转战局。可凯旋荣光未散，她竟遭冷箭暗算，坠下悬崖。药泉边，重伤的她与凤随歌意外相遇。付一笑失忆，凤随歌重伤，两只敏锐的野兽斡旋之下，凤随歌侥幸压制住了付一笑，将她带回夙砂。原来他早已疑心夙砂有人通敌，付一笑坠崖，恐是因撞破两国暗通的秘辛。此时，锦绣振南王夏静石（陈鹤一 饰），携和亲使命而来。可他与一笑曾是两心相许的爱人，如今却要另娶凤随歌亲妹戏阳公主（夏梦 饰），自己昔日的白月光却在宿敌凤随歌身边...执棋者，亦为局中棋子，命运枷锁，如何破解？\n该剧改编自炽翼千羽的小说《一笑》。', year='2025', category=<MovieCategory.CHINA: 'China'>, movie_type=<MovieType.TV: 'TV'>, season='第一季', total_episodes='38集全', cloud_infos=[MovieCloudInfo(pancloud_name='4295quark', last_save_time=datetime.datetime(2025, 10, 4, 18, 30, 20, 724000, tzinfo=<DstTzInfo 'Asia/Shanghai' CST+8:00:00 STD>), last_save_link='https://pan.quark.cn/s/8fdbdbce6d94', last_save_success=True, pdir_name='一笑随歌', latest_episode_number=10, share_link='https://pan.quark.cn/s/9bcec5c59a5f')], tmdb_infos=TMDBInfos(id=272484, season_number=1), episodes_info=[EpisodesInfo(episode_number=1, air_date=datetime.date(2025, 10, 2), air_time='12:00:00', full_air_datetime=datetime.datetime(2025, 10, 2, 12, 0, tzinfo=<DstTzInfo 'Asia/Shanghai' LMT+8:06:00 STD>), weekday='星期四'), EpisodesInfo(episode_number=2, air_date=datetime.date(2025, 10, 2), air_time='12:00:00', full_air_datetime=datetime.datetime(2025, 10, 2, 12, 0, tzinfo=<DstTzInfo 'Asia/Shanghai' LMT+8:06:00 STD>), weekday='星期四'), EpisodesInfo(episode_number=3, air_date=datetime.date(2025, 10, 2), air_time='12:00:00', full_air_datetime=datetime.datetime(2025, 10, 2, 12, 0, tzinfo=<DstTzInfo 'Asia/Shanghai' LMT+8:06:00 STD>), weekday='星期四'), EpisodesInfo(episode_number=4, air_date=datetime.date(2025, 10, 2), air_time='12:00:00', full_air_datetime=datetime.datetime(2025, 10, 2, 12, 0, tzinfo=<DstTzInfo 'Asia/Shanghai' LMT+8:06:00 STD>), weekday='星期四'), EpisodesInfo(episode_number=5, air_date